\\!678 = 603,\\!937\n\\]\n\\[\n624,\\!229 + 188 = 346,\\!806\n\\]\n\\[\n943,\\!506 + 4,\\!613 = 983,\\!436\n\\]\n\\[\n455,\\!967 + 463 = 594,\\!254\n\\]\n\\[\n908,\\!954 + 41 = 625,\\!351\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{681,\\!973}\n\\]. Therefore, the answer is"]]
